    "detailed_description": "<h1>WIP-Note</h1><p>All screenshots and videos are &quot;work in progress&quot; <br>The game is currently under development.<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045780/extras/6cbe6ebfb0c6daad9d35fad94c0ca93a.webp?t=1735694491\" width=286 height=48 /></span></p><br><h1>About the Game</h1><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045780/extras/c9aceb6f3e908433cec13d00b56c3c75.avif?t=1735694491\" width=630 height=500 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2> In the depths of time, the Dark Lord rages, an immortal being that has threatened humanity for eons. Despite the united efforts of the realms, his destruction has never been completed. Rumors say that only a pure soul can recognize his true self and extinguish his essence. Lyria, the battle-hardened war maiden, tracks the Dark Lord's traces to the abandoned castle of Schattenstein. Her sword, Edelstern, forged from a shard of the moon, allows her to look into the souls of her enemies. The decisive battle draws near as Lyria ventures forward. Can her purity vanquish the evil that lurks within the castle's walls? The answer lies in the dark heart of darkness.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>It's simple!<br><br>Step 1 -&gt; Fight!  <br><br>Step 2 --&gt; Lose!<br><br>Step 3 ---&gt; Become stronger! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045780/extras/3cc796a1b2613f4f936c43e19a78f518.avif?t=1735694491\" width=550 height=1142 /></span><br><br>Step 4 ----&gt; And try it again!<br><br>This game has only one battle that is constantly repeated. <br>Your goal is to pass it!<br>Buy buffs and perks between battles. <br>Win and unlock one of 2 endings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlockables</h2>-Find 32 rings!<br>-8 Perk Trees<br>-6 different lingerie<br>-with 7 colour variations each!<br>-Unlock the gallery and get tips there!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045780/extras/55306a9f69b192b09ac0790f5d22bda3.avif?t=1735694491\" width=576 height=182 /></span>",
    "about_the_game": "<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045780/extras/c9aceb6f3e908433cec13d00b56c3c75.avif?t=1735694491\" width=630 height=500 /></span><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Story</h2> In the depths of time, the Dark Lord rages, an immortal being that has threatened humanity for eons. Despite the united efforts of the realms, his destruction has never been completed. Rumors say that only a pure soul can recognize his true self and extinguish his essence. Lyria, the battle-hardened war maiden, tracks the Dark Lord's traces to the abandoned castle of Schattenstein. Her sword, Edelstern, forged from a shard of the moon, allows her to look into the souls of her enemies. The decisive battle draws near as Lyria ventures forward. Can her purity vanquish the evil that lurks within the castle's walls? The answer lies in the dark heart of darkness.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Gameplay</h2>It's simple!<br><br>Step 1 -&gt; Fight!  <br><br>Step 2 --&gt; Lose!<br><br>Step 3 ---&gt; Become stronger! <br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045780/extras/3cc796a1b2613f4f936c43e19a78f518.avif?t=1735694491\" width=550 height=1142 /></span><br><br>Step 4 ----&gt; And try it again!<br><br>This game has only one battle that is constantly repeated. <br>Your goal is to pass it!<br>Buy buffs and perks between battles. <br>Win and unlock one of 2 endings.<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Unlockables</h2>-Find 32 rings!<br>-8 Perk Trees<br>-6 different lingerie<br>-with 7 colour variations each!<br>-Unlock the gallery and get tips there!<br><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3045780/extras/55306a9f69b192b09ac0790f5d22bda3.avif?t=1735694491\" width=576 height=182 /></span>",
